{"id":"a1f30c48-2b6e-4c19-8d21-6f5a0b7c9e01","content":"Prefers concise answers and no preamble: state the result first, then the reasoning.","scope":"global","sources":["claude-code"],"tags":["preference"],"created_at":"2026-11-15T02:10:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:10:00.000Z","status":"active"}
{"id":"b47e91d5-5c02-4f88-a173-2d8e6c4b0a92","content":"Use pnpm, not npm: the store lives at ~/.pnpm-store and lockfiles must stay pnpm-lock.yaml.","scope":"global","sources":["codex","cursor"],"tags":["tooling"],"created_at":"2026-11-15T02:12:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-15T03:41:00.000Z","status":"active"}
{"id":"c9d2a04e-7b31-4a55-9f06-1c3d8e5b7f23","content":"Every write command runs dry first; `--apply` only after an explicit yes.","scope":"global","sources":["cli"],"tags":["convention"],"created_at":"2026-11-15T02:15:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:15:00.000Z","status":"active"}
